WEBVTT

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:05.130
Mikoto, standing on the path
I don't want to travel

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:07.610
and an ogre,
standing on the path that I do...

00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:11.610
Whichever I choose, I'll have regrets.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:18.110
If that's the case...

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:37.390
I'll choose the path I prefer!

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:40.250
I do want to stop you, Mikoto.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.890
But I still

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:44.640
want to go with you, too!

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.050
Stop it!

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:52.900
You can't choose me!

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:54.650
Mikoto?

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:57.760
W-Wait!

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:00.220
Go after him.

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:04.180
You chose him, after all.

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:06.710
You should really try to learn
more about him.

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:08.790
You're right!

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:10.730
Thank you, Sumeragi!

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:17.970
A dazzling girl.

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:51.020
Mikoto! Wait, Mikoto!

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:56.450
I'm sorry.

00:02:56.450 --> 00:02:58.030
I shouldn't have made that foolish offer.

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:00.720
I was perfectly aware of your ideals.

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:02.350
I'm awful.

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:05.450
I can't help but act rashly
in the presence of an ogre.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:09.540
But I really do want to go with you!

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:16.720
Do you remember that hypothetical
I once presented you?

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:21.180
That if a demihuman killed your parents,
you'd hate all demihumans?

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:23.620
I hate them.

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:26.430
The hatred I feel for them never abates!

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:29.450
That's why I kill them.

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:33.690
But no amount of killing ever brings relief.

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:35.710
So I keep hating them!

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:37.940
I keep killing them.

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.190
The cycle never ends.

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:42.620
I can't even tell them apart anymore.

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:45.060
So I just kill them all.

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:46.950
But I'm also fine with that.

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:50.460
Then, as someone promoting harmony
with demihumans,

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:52.710
if I stood with them against you,

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:54.210
what would you do then?

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:00.410
Mikoto?

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:06.190
What?

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:16.610
Monsters!

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:18.480
O-Ogres!

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:21.390
My eye...

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:32.420
The place is just crawling with humans.

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:34.750
Should I kill them all?

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.980
There's no point in killing the small fry.

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:37.980
Let them go.

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:39.250
Fine.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:41.780
Shall I scout from above?

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:43.120
Please.

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:45.260
Shinki, look after this one.

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:46.430
Right.

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:51.420
I hear the enemy's more powerful
than Sumeragi.

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:53.630
Keep your guard with you, Todoroki.

00:04:53.630 --> 00:04:55.640
You, too, Basoo.

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:57.020
Todoroki.

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:58.860
What should we do with Daminki?

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:01.280
Set him down there.

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:07.200
You sure we can just leave him?

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:11.660
Nobody can harm him while he's sleeping.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:13.910
True enough.

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:19.890
If we make enough commotion,
the Peach Boy should appear.

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:22.280
Let's split up and cause some damage.

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:23.180
Sure!

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:27.670
Hey, did you hear that?

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:30.180
Yeah, it sounded like an explosion.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:34.480
All tournament participants!

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:36.310
The tournament is hereby canceled!

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:38.310
Where did that—

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:40.940
Ogres have descended on our kingdom!

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:45.230
The knights have their hands full
with evacuations.

00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:46.320
And so...

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.740
We're asking for your cooperation!

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:50.700
Whoever brings back an ogre's head

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:53.200
will receive 500 gold!

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:54.980
Five hundred?

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:56.520
That's amazing.

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:00.710
That explosion earlier

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:04.710
suggests something on that thing's level.

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:08.270
"It's too much for you. Just run away."

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:11.740
I doubt anyone would listen if I said that.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:17.270
Even so, it's not as if I have the power
to slay an ogre, either.

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:19.600
I guess I'll be relying on Sally in the end.

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:24.230
Hey, buddy!

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:27.440
You're... Barsus, wasn't it?

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:30.990
Nice! I can't believe you remember me!

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:37.720
You beat me in one hit on the first day.

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:42.460
I never forget the men I fight.

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:45.660
You're pretty cool, buddy!

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:47.010
Ow!

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:51.200
Oh, so you're after the ogre bounty?

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:53.510
I don't make much as a lumberjack.

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:57.020
I was hoping to treat my family
to a piece of the good life.

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:58.710
Better not try it.

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:02.770
Not even a whole band of humans
can hope to face an ogre.

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:07.680
If you really care about your family,
the best thing you can do is be with them.

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:09.030
S-Sure.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:11.330
You're a nice guy.

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:14.230
Yeah. It gets me into trouble sometimes.

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:18.790
But you're right.
I should get back to my family and—

00:07:22.950 --> 00:07:24.540
B-Barsus?!

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:28.350
A single black cloud in a clear sky?

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:31.850
I meant to kill you both together,

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:33.680
but the big one absorbed it all.

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:36.680
You're a very lucky man.

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:38.430
Peach Boy.

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:39.710
"Peach"...?

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:41.440
Who is this kid?

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:43.190
Or... is he an ogre?!

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:44.770
Very observant.

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:46.910
Yes, I am an ogre.

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:48.690
The high ogre, Todoroki.

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:51.700
And your enemy, Peach Boy!

00:07:53.340 --> 00:07:55.450
Lightning struck.

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:57.950
Lightning in a blue sky?

00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:01.460
I wonder...

00:08:05.740 --> 00:08:07.470
Is that Basoo?!

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:09.760
It can't be...

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:12.470
Shinki, too?!

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:15.470
Which means that lightning strike was...

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:22.040
Todoroki!

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:25.260
Must be ogres, right?

00:08:25.260 --> 00:08:27.480
Are they after me again?

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:32.500
But the timing seems
a little too convenient.

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:36.240
Is that Sumeragi guy involved somehow?

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:39.490
A reasonable inference...
But really, you wound me.

00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:42.720
Sumeragi! What are you doing here?

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:45.870
Just seeking out the source of the commotion.

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:49.420
You're a pretty high-ranked ogre, right?

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:53.010
Can't you convince them
to stop their attack?

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:56.510
I could, perhaps.

00:08:56.730 --> 00:09:00.770
But why should I help you, my enemies?

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:02.030
Huh?!

00:09:02.030 --> 00:09:03.690
Have you forgotten already?

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:06.440
You took Mikoto's hand earlier!

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:10.770
That madman slays ogres
without reason or discrimination.

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:13.690
Yet you took his hand.

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:16.270
And now you want me to help you?

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:18.560
A bit self-serving, isn't it?

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:19.700
Well...

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.140
Maybe it is, but...

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:27.740
Sumeragi. Are you testing me?

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:29.370
Or mocking me?

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:34.970
Your questions should really be
about your current predicament.

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:38.950
There are four ogres attacking.

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:43.850
Todoroki, the strongest high ogre
in their group,

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:47.350
is facing the weakest of your own, Hawthorn.

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:51.350
Do you see?

00:09:51.350 --> 00:09:54.870
If you don't save him quickly,
he'll be killed.

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:58.410
However, I have no intention
of letting you pass.

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:01.780
Well? What's your move?

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:07.540
I don't know this "Peach Boy" thing
you're talking about.

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:09.430
But you're an ogre,

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:12.040
and you killed Barsus.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.170
What of it?

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:18.060
I appreciate it, kid.

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:20.930
You've given me a reason to fight.

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:24.180
Because I need to make you pay.

00:10:24.490 --> 00:10:28.440
And I need to make <i>you</i> pay, Peach Boy!

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:30.690
That light in his hand...

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:33.820
And that unnatural black cloud...

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:35.820
He's...

00:10:37.550 --> 00:10:39.820
an ogre that controls lightning!

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:43.420
You let the sword take the hit that time.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:45.960
Well done.

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:46.950
But...

00:10:57.220 --> 00:10:59.220
What in the world?

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:02.400
You came to attack, then fell asleep?

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:04.720
I can't imagine what you might be thinking.

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:09.520
Ah well...

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:12.730
I slay any ogre I come across.

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:17.980
What in the...

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:20.750
My vision is... suddenly...

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:26.410
Damn. When did I...

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:34.950
Hawthorn's going to be killed at this rate!

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:38.080
Frau, go on ahead
to where the lightning struck!

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:39.300
Right!

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:43.800
I'm going to try to persuade
the other ogre, Shinki, to stop this!

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:49.310
He might be able to stop Todoroki, too!

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:52.310
Carrot is worried about Hawthorn!

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:07.280
You're the harefolk
working for the Peach Boy!

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:18.800
So I have to beat you to pass?

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:24.610
I see you won't say,
"I'll just have to abandon Hawthorn, then."

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:27.550
An unfortunate lack of determination
from you.

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:33.690
What?! Abandoning him is as far from
determination as a person can get!

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:36.560
I'll protect everything I set my mind to!

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:43.450
Because I have the power to do it!

00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:45.320
Sounds like a bluff.

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:51.370
Try calling it a bluff
after I beat the heck out of you!

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:06.020
Stop squirming.

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:10.430
I've got only my wooden sword.

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:11.820
You...

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:16.160
After all your big talk,
now you're running away?!

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:17.560
Shameless coward!

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:21.690
Get him angry, then...

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:24.190
Come out, Peach Boy!

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:30.190
Finish it in one strike!

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:36.710
I wasn't running away.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:38.710
I said I'd make you pay, remember?

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:47.180
M-Monster!

00:13:55.220 --> 00:13:56.420
Monster!

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:58.480
Monster!

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.270
Shinki!

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:08.110
Meki?

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:09.450
I see.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:12.430
You've shrunk a bit
since losing your horn.

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:15.460
Why are you doing this?

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:16.870
Are you here after Sally?

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:18.170
"Sally"?

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:22.380
I see.
The Peach Boy is a woman?

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:25.380
What are you here for?
Tell me!

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:29.130
What's so funny?!

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:34.260
We're here to avenge you, Meki.

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:35.520
Huh?!

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:39.290
Sumeragi apparently told him,
at the Hundred Ogre Gathering,

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:44.050
that the Peach Boy killed you.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:48.470
Why would Sumeragi say that?

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:52.750
And more importantly...
why would Todoroki want to avenge me?

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:55.790
You really don't know?

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:56.290
Huh?

00:14:57.930 --> 00:14:59.360
I guess you wouldn't.

00:14:59.360 --> 00:15:01.790
Well, typical of ogres.

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:08.130
But... if he's here to avenge me,
seeing me should make him stop, right?

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:11.180
Sure, but I'm not going
to let you reach him.

00:15:13.020 --> 00:15:16.230
Meki. I'm going to kill you myself.

00:15:16.230 --> 00:15:18.310
Right here, once and for all.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:23.380
I caught him by surprise
and gave him all I had.

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:26.320
I hope it at least knocked him out, but...

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:31.570
Yeah, it won't be that easy.

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:50.010
I was wondering
how you managed to kill Meki.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:51.590
Now I know.

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:55.600
You used these cowardly tactics
to kill Meki.

00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:56.790
"Meki"?

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:03.230
Even though you killed Meki,
I at least thought I'd kill you in proper duel.

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:06.430
But a coward like you
doesn't deserve the dignity!

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:08.230
I'm just going to kill you!

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:12.430
Quite good.

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:14.250
I should wait for now.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:16.450
Should wait for now.

00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:17.740
But...

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:19.250
Can't wait!

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:46.490
Did you forget?

00:16:46.490 --> 00:16:49.520
I can stretch my body as far as I want.

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:56.110
That was quite a howl.

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:57.330
But is that all you've got?

00:16:59.340 --> 00:17:00.160
My eye?

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:02.790
Why? My eye's power didn't activate!

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:16.570
An explosion?

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:18.300
No... a lightning strike?!

00:17:22.170 --> 00:17:25.940
This is my cannon,
Raijin Ogre Thunder.

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:29.060
Now I'm going to kill you, Peach Boy.

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:36.570
Are you that desperate to let Todoroki fight?

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:38.530
No, Meki.

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:41.580
I want to kill you, because you're part
of the coexistence faction.

00:17:43.740 --> 00:17:45.330
"Coexistence faction"?

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:51.230
Ogres who heed Sumeragi's call
to promote coexistence with humans.

00:17:51.560 --> 00:17:55.970
There are some ogres with little in the way
of resentment and will to fight.

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:59.470
And their number is growing by the day.

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:02.720
Coexistence... between humans and ogres?

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:05.130
That's what Sally said.

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:10.140
And you're the first
of the coexistence faction to

00:18:10.140 --> 00:18:12.700
betray ogres and dwell with humans!

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:15.490
I never betrayed the ogres!

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:19.740
Then, could you kill the people
you're traveling with?

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:21.490
Well...

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:23.990
See? You can't even say it.

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:27.500
That's just the problem.

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:31.100
I see we can't talk this out.

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:32.500
Which means...

00:18:32.720 --> 00:18:36.360
I'll have to beat you
and then go to see Todoroki!

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:38.760
An absurd claim,
from an ogre without a horn!

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:45.770
Why won't my eye's power...

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:51.030
Are you... Are you not an ogre—

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:04.530
You can think it over after
you have the heck beaten out of you.

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:10.290
What do you expect to protect,
while relying on such an unknown power?

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:15.630
To give closure to my friend, Todoroki,

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:18.800
I will kill all
associated with the Peach Boy.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:21.800
Wait for me on the other side!

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:44.950
It's not going to work.

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:49.950
Brute force strikes can't hurt me.

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:52.380
I was on the lookout for <i>xian dao</i>,

00:19:52.380 --> 00:19:53.530
but this is nothing!

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:55.710
You just have brute force!

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:58.660
If you could use your cannon,
I'd be in trouble,

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:01.570
but you can't beat me in your state!

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:07.140
I don't have the power
to pierce his body now.

00:20:07.590 --> 00:20:08.850
What do I do?

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:12.770
That's an ogre for you.

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:14.850
Utterly absurd levels of power...

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:28.590
You're treating me
to quite the spectacle before I die.

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:30.360
I appreciate that.

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:34.870
You're a fool
if you're not running this time.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:38.930
It's pretty clear
I can't escape this one.

00:20:39.540 --> 00:20:40.880
And...

00:20:41.140 --> 00:20:44.880
my companions probably saw your lightning
and are on their way here.

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:50.390
Which means
I've got only one option right now:

00:20:50.820 --> 00:20:55.800
Hold you in place for every second I can!

00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:58.400
You think your companions' arrival
will save you?

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:01.150
It doesn't matter whether they do.

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:04.150
It's still what I have to do.

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:08.930
You may be a coward,
but at least you have some determination.

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:13.950
I'll show my appreciation
with a full-power strike!

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:17.970
Die in light, Peach Boy!

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:24.220
I've been spared death time and again.

00:21:24.560 --> 00:21:26.180
But now it's all over.

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:27.300
Which means...

00:21:27.940 --> 00:21:32.810
Here at the end,
I'll greet death with dignity!

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:42.490
Guys,

00:21:43.340 --> 00:21:44.980
I leave the rest to you!

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.460
She blocked my lightning?!

00:22:00.550 --> 00:22:03.060
You really do have a death wish.

00:22:03.660 --> 00:22:05.970
Is it something to do
with how you were raised?

00:22:07.610 --> 00:22:08.570
What...

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:10.970
What are you doing here?!

00:22:12.730 --> 00:22:13.740
Winny!

00:23:46.580 --> 00:23:49.250
Next time: "Mikoto and Mikoto."
